window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p></p><p>Enchantress witch Elle, werewolf - warlock Fergie, and spell witch Rebecca face their most difficult case yet, when a stolen medieval document leads them to discover a 450-year-old familial curse—a curse they need to break! They learn that the document is connected to murders and magical mayhem that has plagued two Scottish families for centuries. The stakes are raised when the purloined parchment will be the ransom for two kidnapped witches. But where is it? <br><br>In this multi-layered witchy mystery romance novel, Elle and Fergie explore their growing romantic feelings when they join their supernatural powers to fight the escalating danger, solve crimes, and break a evil enchantment. As Rebecca struggles after losing everything to the Edinburgh coven, she hides her own dark secrets.<br><br>When Elle decides to recruit her nemesis, Niall, an enchanter who was once her lover, they’ll need to break a dark spell on him, too!<br><br>From London to Bath to the stone circle at Avebury, join Elle, Fergie, Rebecca, and Niall in a new mystery case as the Scottish witches travel to England to recover a stolen artifact, rescue kidnapped English witches, and break a curse that could end them all—a curse that even poses a threat to the monarchy.<br><br>But will Niall help or hinder this investigation? Will his bewitched obsession with Elle create a love triangle that could destroy her new love with werewolf hunk Fergie? Will they ever make it back to Scotland with their stones intact?<br><br>THE WITCH DETECTIVES is a continuing paranormal mystery series with fast-paced plots that twist and turn, witchy romance, and supernatural thrills.</p>"; 
